                    What shared should actually mean

I would define it like this:

shared
=
"What information is allowed to cross this boundary,
and what shape must that information have?"

For example:

core/audio
    │
    │ TranscriptSegment
    ▼
shared/types/audio.ts
    │
    │
    ▼
core/conversation

And:

core/conversation
    │
    │ ConversationAnalysis
    ▼
shared/types/conversation.ts
    │
    ▼
core/interview

And:

core/interview
    │
    │ InterviewTaskAnalysis
    ▼
shared/types/interviews.ts
    │
    ▼
core/context

And eventually:

core/context
    │
    │ RelevantContext
    ▼
core/prompts
    │
    │ AIRequest
    ▼
core/ai
